DOMAIN-SUFFIX,maven.apache.org
DOMAIN,repo1.maven.org
DOMAIN,search.maven.org
DOMAIN,central.sonatype.com
DOMAIN,central.sonatype.org

# Gradle 官网、发行包与插件仓库
# 包含 services.gradle.org、downloads.gradle.org、plugins.gradle.org
